# CODEOWNERS for iam-customer-managed-pipeline
#
# This repository is the policy-data repository tracked by the pipeline. It
# must be protected on the Git provider side (see docs/branch-protection.md)
# so that:
#   * Push to the tracked branch requires a signed, CODEOWNERS-approved PR.
#   * The pipeline itself is NOT auto-triggered (DetectChanges=false): a
#     human operator starts the pipeline execution only after review.
#
# ALL changes to pipeline source code (source/**/*.py) and all pipeline IaC
# (cfn/**, terraform/**, .github/**, CODEOWNERS) must be approved by the
# security owners below. Changes to templates/*.json need normal review.

# Pipeline source code - any change requires a security owner approval.
/source/                        @dennisasilva/security-owners
/scripts/                       @dennisasilva/security-owners

# Pipeline infrastructure (buildspecs, IAM, S3, pipeline wiring).
/cfn/                           @dennisasilva/security-owners
/terraform/                     @dennisasilva/security-owners

# Governance files themselves must be protected.
/CODEOWNERS                     @dennisasilva/security-owners
/.github/                       @dennisasilva/security-owners
/docs/branch-protection.md      @dennisasilva/security-owners
